        {
          "text": "Ka’dini ’ba angu ndeni ’diyi fe ’ba Yudani ma dri aka aka, azini yi ecandi yi yini jo siria tu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
